{"unit_id":"YuMo-233__dsh-subagent-model-switch#card-zh","repo":"YuMo-233/dsh-subagent-model-switch","commit":"e6b10f1372c629461c2e89449557dab56908f41a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-model-switch 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的子代理模型路由插件。它在子代理会话头部加入模型选择菜单，并通过服务钩子更新模型请求和系统提示词。用户可以按提供商选择可用模型、设置推理强度，或清除覆写以继承父会话设置；选择会保存并在重启后恢复。适合需要在不中断上下文的情况下调整队友或子代理模型的 DSH 用户。运行时需要 DSH 环境，不需要额外 API 密钥配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:429-469","index.js:40-65","index.js:205-236"]}
{"unit_id":"YuMo-233__dsh-subagent-model-switch#card-en","repo":"YuMo-233/dsh-subagent-model-switch","commit":"e6b10f1372c629461c2e89449557dab56908f41a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-subagent-model-switch adds a model selector to DSH web subagent session headers. Choose a provider, model, and reasoning effort, or clear an override to inherit the parent setting. Choices update later requests and persist across restarts.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:429-469","index.js:40-65","index.js:205-236"]}
