{"unit_id":"YuMo-233__dsh-subagent-model-switch#feature-model-menu","repo":"YuMo-233/dsh-subagent-model-switch","commit":"e6b10f1372c629461c2e89449557dab56908f41a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-model-switch 的功能「子代理模型选择」：在子代理会话头部打开菜单，按提供商浏览可用模型并选择模型；选择提交给宿主服务，之后的模型请求使用新选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:429-469","index.js:205-228"]}
