{"unit_id":"YuMo-233__dsh-subagent-model-switch#feature-persist","repo":"YuMo-233/dsh-subagent-model-switch","commit":"e6b10f1372c629461c2e89449557dab56908f41a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-model-switch 的功能「保存模型覆写」：将子代理会话的模型选择写入 DSH 存储目录，并在插件加载时恢复，重启后仍保留选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:104-137"]}
